# Frozen Phy wiring

Quiz runners own tracking. `public/` and `dist/` quiz folders are copies.

Change `quizzes/<slug>/js/quizData.js`, then run `npm run build:content`. Leave this file unchanged.

Do not edit `postMessage`, `uniplus:quizAnswer`, `QUIZ_META`, `quizId`, or network calls. If the teacher needs that, stop and name the technical owner.
